00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:31.346
So, so tell everybody
what the movie's about,

00:03:31.346 --> 00:03:32.610
other than being in a storm.

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.740
It looks like your kid's been taken.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:37.380
- Yeah, so my kid is kidnapped

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.000
and I enlist the help of my neighbor

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.630
who's kind of this grumpy
woman who doesn't like me.

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.910
And we have to go on this rescue mission

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:48.240
to get my child back in
the middle of this storm

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.440
in the middle of the night.

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:50.940
But we are forced to work together.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.530
We're two women who don't like each other,

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:54.870
