life, that's devastating.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:11.640
Is that hard?

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:12.960
- You know, yeah.

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.060
- To like pop out of?

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.950
- The thing is it's a very dark
place to go to as an actor.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:17.783
- Yeah.

00:04:17.783 --> 00:04:19.650
- But I don't know for me,

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.990
