those really uncomfortable,

00:04:30.389 --> 00:04:33.063
uncomfortable parts of my mind.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:37.200
You know, but, but this
film is very empowering

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.033
- As well.
- Yeah.

00:04:38.033 --> 00:04:39.659
And so it was a lot about tapping

00:04:39.659 --> 00:04:42.540
